{"unit_id":"csuwzw__dsh-restart#card-zh","repo":"csuwzw/dsh-restart","commit":"dbff50dc07c02705db78a52b8da34cc03952a4f7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-restart 是面向 Windows 桌面版 DeepSeek Harness 的重启插件，在标题栏菜单旁加入「重启」按钮。按钮首次点击进入确认状态，第二次点击后通过本机路由安排结束旧实例并启动新实例，确认状态会在四秒后自动取消。它适合安装插件后需要快速重启 DSH 的桌面用户。需要 Windows 桌面版及 Node.js 20 或更高版本；无需额外密钥或外部服务。重启会终止正在运行的任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:67","client.js:96","index.js:131","restart.ps1:34","package.json:30"]}
{"unit_id":"csuwzw__dsh-restart#card-en","repo":"csuwzw/dsh-restart","commit":"dbff50dc07c02705db78a52b8da34cc03952a4f7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-restart adds a title bar button to Windows desktop DSH. Click once to confirm and again to restart; confirmation expires after four seconds. It ends the old process and launches a new one. Requires Windows and Node.js 20+. Running tasks are terminated.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:67","client.js:96","index.js:131","restart.ps1:34","package.json:30"]}
